        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential is delighted to present  34 Millbrook Grove, ideally located in the heart of Donaghmede – a mature and well-established residential area on Dublin’s northside. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room, a separate dining area and a well-appointed kitchen. The downstairs accommodation also benefits from a family bathroom, separate laundry room and useful storage space, providing excellent functionality for modern living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous primary bedroom, along with ample storage throughout. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with a wide range of amenities on your doorstep including schools, shops, parks, and leisure facilities. Donaghmede Shopping Centre, the DART at Howth Junction, and multiple bus routes are all within easy reach, offering convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The M50 and M1 motorways are also just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.*"
